  "theorem_name": "ExactlyTenValuationOnesOtherwiseTwoCycleExclusion",
  "declared_proposition": "No positive accelerated Collatz cycle has a valuation period with exactly ten entries equal to one and every other entry equal to two, including primitive and imprimitive periods.",
